<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-κοπή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting</i>
			<i>close, pollarding</i>, of trees, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.17.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>cutting
				down</i>, <i>felling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιᾶς
				ἐπικοπῆς εἶναι</span> fall by a single <i>blow</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				38.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				49.29
			</span></i> (owing to f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.103
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. in
			building, <i>dressing, trimming</i> face of blocks of masonry, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικόπτων τὰς ἐπικοπάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					35.43
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Delos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3073.71
			</span></i> (Lebad.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. στρωτήρων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.1484.235
			</span></i> (Epid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<i>interruption</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
